    "name": "AIRA & Van's Last Journey",
    "steam_appid": 3818690,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818690/extras/2f124df8dd3ff5db27d4c53a9b6ea0ee.poster.avif?t=1755112828\" width=616 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818690/extras/2f124df8dd3ff5db27d4c53a9b6ea0ee.webm?t=1755112828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818690/extras/2f124df8dd3ff5db27d4c53a9b6ea0ee.mp4?t=1755112828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy relaxing point &amp; click zen puzzles and engaging cozy mechanics, paired with touching storytelling, beautiful pixel art, and original soundtracks. Step into Aira\u2019s heartfelt and moving story. A young woman named Aira sets off on a journey in her grandmother\u2019s nostalgic camper van, hoping to fulfill her final wish while searching for inner peace and rediscovering her passion for art. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will Aira find herself \u2014 or something beyond what she ever imagined?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818690/extras/13a65f91a37589d6250af857dbdc8e7d.poster.avif?t=1755112828\" width=616 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818690/extras/13a65f91a37589d6250af857dbdc8e7d.webm?t=1755112828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818690/extras/13a65f91a37589d6250af857dbdc8e7d.mp4?t=1755112828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow down and take a deep breath as you experience life\u2019s hidden moments through simple, thoughtful puzzles. Sweep away the past, tidy up the present, and create a cozy new home for Aira.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818690/extras/7881c7e2dd43fbf88e2b55f4c5f3acc7.poster.avif?t=1755112828\" width=616 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818690/extras/7881c7e2dd43fbf88e2b55f4c5f3acc7.webm?t=1755112828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818690/extras/7881c7e2dd43fbf88e2b55f4c5f3acc7.mp4?t=1755112828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore the van from an abandoned mess to a cozy home full of life and new memories. Witness how Aira\u2019s gentle care transforms every detail into warmth and harmony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818690/extras/6f6a4b9070e7114032544d1d8b93ffba.poster.avif?t=1755112828\" width=616 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818690/extras/6f6a4b9070e7114032544d1d8b93ffba.webm?t=1755112828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818690/extras/6f6a4b9070e7114032544d1d8b93ffba.mp4?t=1755112828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle details and quiet scenes that reveal beauty and emotional depth in everyday life. A soothing journey of gentle puzzles and mini-games to explore at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Heartfelt Story:</strong> An emotional narrative exploring loss, acceptance, and the journey toward healing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Gameplay:</strong> Enjoy accessible point &amp; click mechanics and cozy puzzles at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Pixel Art:</strong> Gorgeous visuals and cinematic moments evoking nostalgia and warmth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack:</strong> Relaxing music that shifts between melancholy and hope, deepening the emotional experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memorable Moments:</strong> Discover hidden details and subtle scenes that add depth and meaning to every step of Aira\u2019s journey. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Slow down, breathe, and reconnect with yourself. Remember life\u2019s small joys and rediscover who you are with every step Aira takes.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde1<strong>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST TO JOIN THE JOURNEY</strong>\ud83e\udde1</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818690/extras/2f124df8dd3ff5db27d4c53a9b6ea0ee.poster.avif?t=1755112828\" width=616 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818690/extras/2f124df8dd3ff5db27d4c53a9b6ea0ee.webm?t=1755112828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818690/extras/2f124df8dd3ff5db27d4c53a9b6ea0ee.mp4?t=1755112828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy relaxing point &amp; click zen puzzles and engaging cozy mechanics, paired with touching storytelling, beautiful pixel art, and original soundtracks. Step into Aira\u2019s heartfelt and moving story. A young woman named Aira sets off on a journey in her grandmother\u2019s nostalgic camper van, hoping to fulfill her final wish while searching for inner peace and rediscovering her passion for art. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will Aira find herself \u2014 or something beyond what she ever imagined?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818690/extras/13a65f91a37589d6250af857dbdc8e7d.poster.avif?t=1755112828\" width=616 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818690/extras/13a65f91a37589d6250af857dbdc8e7d.webm?t=1755112828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818690/extras/13a65f91a37589d6250af857dbdc8e7d.mp4?t=1755112828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow down and take a deep breath as you experience life\u2019s hidden moments through simple, thoughtful puzzles. Sweep away the past, tidy up the present, and create a cozy new home for Aira.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818690/extras/7881c7e2dd43fbf88e2b55f4c5f3acc7.poster.avif?t=1755112828\" width=616 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818690/extras/7881c7e2dd43fbf88e2b55f4c5f3acc7.webm?t=1755112828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818690/extras/7881c7e2dd43fbf88e2b55f4c5f3acc7.mp4?t=1755112828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore the van from an abandoned mess to a cozy home full of life and new memories. Witness how Aira\u2019s gentle care transforms every detail into warmth and harmony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818690/extras/6f6a4b9070e7114032544d1d8b93ffba.poster.avif?t=1755112828\" width=616 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818690/extras/6f6a4b9070e7114032544d1d8b93ffba.webm?t=1755112828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818690/extras/6f6a4b9070e7114032544d1d8b93ffba.mp4?t=1755112828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle details and quiet scenes that reveal beauty and emotional depth in everyday life. A soothing journey of gentle puzzles and mini-games to explore at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Heartfelt Story:</strong> An emotional narrative exploring loss, acceptance, and the journey toward healing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Gameplay:</strong> Enjoy accessible point &amp; click mechanics and cozy puzzles at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Pixel Art:</strong> Gorgeous visuals and cinematic moments evoking nostalgia and warmth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack:</strong> Relaxing music that shifts between melancholy and hope, deepening the emotional experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memorable Moments:</strong> Discover hidden details and subtle scenes that add depth and meaning to every step of Aira\u2019s journey. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Slow down, breathe, and reconnect with yourself. Remember life\u2019s small joys and rediscover who you are with every step Aira takes.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde1<strong>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST TO JOIN THE JOURNEY</strong>\ud83e\udde1</h2>",
